    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2706" root="بضع" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِضَاعٌ</span></b>  [The <i>giving and receiving merchandise;</i>]
a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْضَعَهُ البِضَاعَةَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِبْتَضَعَ مِنْهُ</span>; [or
rather an inf. n. of which the verb, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاضَعَ</span>, is not
used;] similar to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِرَاضٌ</span>. (TA.)

